      "premise": "Leon, an explorer whose heart is a steam engine, uncovers a record of a \"vanished village\" that has been erased from every map. The settlement was once the legendary keeper of the colossal steam engine known as the \"Sun's Lung,\" a source of limitless heat. Driven to locate the lost power, Leon journeys to the far‑north, where a mysterious crystal fortress called the \"Ice Castle\" rises from the frozen wastes. Within its glittering walls lies a forbidden mechanism that governs the lifespan of all machines."
